    },
    {
      "text": "Prepare four foil squares each large enough to fold over one potato. Spread butter onto foil in a large enough area that the potato will be completely covered when rolled up. Sprinkle salt, garlic, pepper, and Italian seasoning evenly over foil. Roll each potato in the foil; puncture the package (including the potato) with a fork or knife a few times.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oFDF6BS6brnYMj1ZC0mNl-HmCBo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/35536-leslies-salty-grilled-potatoes-ddmfs-step2-0012-4x3-ac09f67a17fa43dea32c00fd8fef5ab0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/35536/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook on the preheated grill until soft, turning potatoes often, about 1 hour.",
